### Health
GET http://localhost:9526/health
Accept: application/json

###
### Liveness
GET http://localhost:9526/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

###
### Readiness
GET http://localhost:9526/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

###
### Startup
GET http://localhost:9526/health/startup
Accept: application/json

###
### Metrics
GET http://localhost:9526/metrics

###
### ACL Ruleset (requires Basic Auth)
GET http://localhost:9526/api/v1/acl/ruleset
Authorization: Basic {{acl_basic_auth}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Put ACL Ruleset (requires Basic Auth)
PUT http://localhost:9526/api/v1/acl/ruleset
Authorization: Basic {{acl_basic_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "v1",
  "rules": [
    {
      "identity": {
        "username": "demo-user"
      },
      "allow_publish": [
        "demo/#"
      ],
      "allow_subscribe": [
        "demo/#"
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###
### Cluster Health Summary
GET http://localhost:9526/api/v1/cluster/health
Accept: application/json

###
### Cluster Overview (leader/replication/backlog)
GET http://localhost:9526/api/v1/cluster/overview
Accept: application/json
